flowchart TD
    subgraph Store["Store Source (Shopify / Salla / Mock)"]
        S1[Product Data]
        S2[Inventory Data]
        S3[Order Data]
    end

    subgraph Ads["Ad Platform Source (Meta / Google Ads / Mock)"]
        A1[Campaign Data]
        A2[Ad Spend Data]
    end

    SC[Store Connector]
    AC[Ads Connector]

    S1 --> SC
    S2 --> SC
    S3 --> SC
    A1 --> AC
    A2 --> AC

    subgraph Canonical["Canonical Layer (PostgreSQL)"]
        P[(Products)]
        C[(Campaigns)]
        CP[(CampaignProduct)]
        AS[(AdSpend)]
        O[(Orders)]
        EV[(Events - append only)]
    end

    SC -->|writes current state| P
    SC -->|writes current state| O
    SC -->|writes state-change history| EV
    AC -->|writes current state| C
    AC -->|writes current state| AS
    AC -->|writes state-change history| EV
    SC -.->|targeting relationships| CP
    AC -.->|targeting relationships| CP

    CE[Check Engine]
    P --> CE
    C --> CE
    CP --> CE
    AS --> CE
    O --> CE
    EV -->|"e.g. stock_out timestamp"| CE

    F[(Findings)]
    CE -->|"evidence + estimatedCost\n(deterministic, never LLM-computed)"| F

    AI[AI Service]
    F -->|evidence only| AI
    AI -->|explanation + confidence\n written back| F

    API[API]
    F --> API
    API --> Web[Web Dashboard]
    API --> Mobile[Mobile App / Push Notification]

    Merchant((Merchant))
    Mobile --> Merchant
    Web --> Merchant
    Merchant -->|approves action| API

    ACT[(Actions)]
    API -->|"idempotencyKey enforced"| ACT
    ACT -->|executes| Ads

    CE -.->|"next scan verifies fix"| F